{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-02_beg","groupId":"main_15","stageId":"main_15-02","title":"所謂奇蹟","storyCode":"15-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"356a760d12ae1f9bee2384aa07809ced57c92a52a18a77146d567c0998ef2ed5","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"卡特斯感染者並沒有死亡，而是不知被誰救下，來到了超越她認知的地方。在倫蒂尼姆事件結束的三年後，羅德島本艦上的許多幹員陸續出發前往各地增援。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_g1_rhodescorridor_bc"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……鐘聲嗎？為什麼會從所有方向同時響起？"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的聲音很小，小到無法在四周的牆壁上激起一絲回音。\n每當那濃霧般的光芒到來，牆壁上都會出現許多細密的小孔，輕輕張合呼吸。等到光芒消失，牆壁又會變得潔白而沉默。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那道光……和主教爺爺描述的聖城的光很不一樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰冷的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）那是模擬出的F型光譜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能聽到你……我該怎麼找到你？"},{"type":"narration","text":"她的指尖接觸到了牆面，那是一種溫暖、柔軟的感覺，彷彿是與另一根手指的指尖相碰。\n於是她將整個手掌放了上去，緊貼牆壁表面上細膩的紋理。\n無論她的手朝哪個方向滑動，那些紋路都會順著掌心延伸，就像牽著她的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，在回應我？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她朝前小步奔跑，牆壁也向著遠處延伸，引導著她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡有好多扇門，還有好多好多條路，它們都通向哪裡？"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯停下腳步。她看見不遠處，一位“神明”站立在半空。它的輪廓極為高大。\n其肢體表面折射出不同於金屬的晦暗光澤，靈活地將諸多發光的碎片按不同的規律排列，那些碎片的顏色也隨之變換。\n可是女孩注意到，“神明”的頭頂，並沒有光環。那半空中的巨物無視了她的存在，決然地掠過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機械的生命","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"另一個相似的存在靠近了她，停在她的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機械的生命","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♫？"},{"type":"narration","text":"那似乎是一種詢問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽不懂您的話——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“神明”沉默了片刻，放棄了用自己的語言繼續溝通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機械的生命","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）你對語言的使用很原始。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“神明”將靈活的肢體覆蓋於卡特斯的腦後，卡特斯緊張地閉上了雙眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機械的生命","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）無需恐懼，我正在解析你的思維，並上傳到安塞塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機械的生命","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足夠使用。語言。你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機械的生命","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……尚未向量化，推測，判斷。語言，臨時呼叫。需要，共振。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……聽不太懂。請問您能聽懂我說的話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機械的生命","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顯然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——那您是……“神明”嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯緊張地問出了此刻她腦海中最渴望得到答案的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機械的生命","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“神明”，疑問。需要，定義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主教爺爺說，神明就是律法的化身，是聖城的主人，會保護生病死去的人。不過他說的這些，在典籍上都沒有記載。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機械的生命","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否定，神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機械的生命","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神，並非，必需。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您不是神明，那麼是誰拯救了我？我為什麼會來到這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_1719_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……或者這裡是死後的國度嗎？您是來指引我繼續前行的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機械的生命","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"問題。太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機械的生命","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"缺少，共振。溝通效率，太差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機械的生命","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屈光者。我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"機械的生命","speakerId":"avg_npc_1725_1","isRemote":false,"text":"展示。部分答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"自稱“屈光者”的生命用肢體在空中劃出一個窗口，並將這扇窗推到最近的一面牆壁上。舷窗模擬出的景象緩緩淡去……\n不知從何處湧出的幽光填滿了整扇窗，圖像逐漸清晰，卡特斯女孩向“窗外”望去——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_i02"},{"type":"narration","text":"一顆破碎的球體，在繁星點綴的黑暗中懸浮著，它被凝固在了死去的瞬間。\n所有沒來得及被講述的過往都碎裂成了塵埃，被拋向冰冷的虛空。\n那些塵埃找到了彼此，圍繞著曾經的家園，它們共同形成了一圈懸浮於虛空中的環。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"60_i02"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯和屈光者就在這圈環上，乘著無帆的巨船在死寂中航行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們看到。航行。打撈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你，顫抖。恐懼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"遠處的那些，閃爍著的、像眼睛一樣的……真的很嚇人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它們就像是星星，可是給我的感覺卻很陌生。它們太多、太近……太亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您不會感到害怕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恐懼並非必需。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"恐懼，太局限，不足以，描述。"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯看見窗口下方的船體牆壁上出現了許多細小孔洞。\n一個白色的亮點出現在很遠很遠的地方，接著不斷擴大、擴大，直到填滿整扇窗戶。\n眩目的光芒從死亡之地的表面撫過，遮蔽了一切，隱藏了一切，它拒絕所有窺探者的解讀。\n卡特斯直視那光芒的源頭，恐懼不斷沖刷著她的心臟，她無法理解——\n那是一顆遙遠星體的蒼白燃燒。\n死去的行星依舊圍繞著它旋轉，而附著於星環上的巨船，不得不一次次迎接它的照耀與悲號，周而復始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看到，確認？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只有，墳墓，沒有，“聖城”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只有，週期，只有，定律。沒有……“神明”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"宇宙。歡迎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"屈光者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"旅者。名字。你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"困惑的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"希爾達。"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我也不知道從什麼時候起，修士們捉弄打趣我的戲稱成為了我的名字。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"……\n……\n管理員權限已確認。\n正在解鎖受限的存取項目：PRTS修復語音記錄#0422\n權限鎖定已解除。\n記錄時間：無法恢復\n播放記錄：待規劃區\n記錄對象：凱爾希"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"倫蒂尼姆塵埃落定，但維多利亞的和平機會渺茫。\n我們還有多少時間？PRTS，我知道你在聽。\n我需要你盡一切可能重建對羅德島中層待規劃區搖籃系統的監視。\n並且……準備向可露希爾開放我的權限層級。\n聲紋口令——Abyss。謝謝。\n我還有很多事情要做……我還有多少事情可以做？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"語音記錄播放完畢。存取記錄清除中……\n3……2……1……記錄已清理。\n管理員，是否解鎖下一項權限記錄？\n操作已確認。即將播放下一項記錄——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>羅德島本艦</><p=2>1101年夏</>\n倫蒂尼姆事件結束三年後"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小嘟嘟”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（飛快地穿行）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小嘟嘟”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（高傲地邀功）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹得不錯，小傢伙，看來可露希爾和Mechanist先生的升級很有效嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小嘟嘟”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（喜悅地轉圈）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，這一塊區域的維修工作差不多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她感覺到一個嬌小的身體撞在她的背上，環抱著她的脖子，咯咯地笑著。\n阿蘭娜很熟悉這個笑聲，她有時為此開心，有時也為此憂慮。\n她順勢背起了她關心的孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小鍋蓋，我聞到了奶油燉菜的味道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘭娜姐，你這樣就沒有驚喜了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太香了，我也沒有辦法嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這麼開心，看來是博士同意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的！我看到有去雷姆必拓辦事處出外勤的志願申請，馬上就報了名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然溫米現在做的飯還是不能治療礦井裡叔叔阿姨的礦石病，但羅德島的哥哥姐姐可以，而我可以填飽他們的肚子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是暴行姐和萊伊姐替我擔保，說不定博士就要當場拒絕我的申請了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，明明陪你一起是我這個監護人的責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有萊伊姐和暴行姐和我一起，不用擔心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過我不在的時候蘭娜姐還是要好好吃飯，我在廚房預留了足足一週量的“每日例湯”，都是你喜歡的口味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後勤部的哥哥姐姐會替我監督你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我會乖乖聽小鍋蓋的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你捨得離開在這裡認識的朋友嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小嘟嘟”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（誇張地點頭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，“小嘟嘟”當然也是我的好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過認識的大家好多都主動申請了去各地的外勤支援，我可不會落後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都很期待任務結束後參觀我們的新家呢。蘭娜姐你可是答應過，改造完成後羅德島會更大更漂亮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（噓——當然，我可是偷偷看過可露希爾的設計圖。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿蘭娜","speakerId":"avg_4178_alanna_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"溫米","speakerId":"avg_4081_warmy_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經勇敢到可以像爸爸一樣向家人們告別出遠門了。蘭娜姐，一定要等著我回家！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"巨型餅乾？刻俄柏給我們的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"很多準備要啟程去各地增援的幹員都收到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"“旅行時一定要吃飽”，小刻是這麼向我強調的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"……就是不知道她分給其他人之前，自己會不會不知不覺吃掉一大半。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我和火神小姐他們約好儘快再把握時間烤製一批，儘量以小刻的名義讓出外勤任務的幹員們都能分到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"到時候就讓索尼婭陪小刻一起去分發吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，那我就把烈夏一起拖上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，反正只要等我們到了目的地，你把欠我的蜂蜜飲料補給我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我隨時聽候冬將軍吩咐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，頭痛……這種要和人打交道的任務果然還是應該交給娜塔莉婭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"早露也分身乏術啊，她也要和阿米婭商量很多具體的行動事宜嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這趟遠門會麻煩一點，畢竟目的地是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"（烏薩斯語）“烏薩斯”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說你擔心搞不定，才把和阿米婭商量的事情丟給早露？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"誰說我搞不定，只是——"},{"type":"narration","text":"烏薩斯，她們一同離開的地方。\n時間過去了許久，凜冬相信她們已經有勇氣去面對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"古米，你的手怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒事，凜冬姐，只是有點酸。幫大家準備的餅乾太多了，餐廳裡大家都累得喘不過氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"連小刻都被火神小姐抓住在餐廳外面乖乖幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心我，凜冬姐。她想要讓照顧過她的幹員離開家也能吃得飽飽的，我也這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們也去幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"反正娜塔莉婭也還要花點時間——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要幫忙？那再算我一個。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，小熊，你看，我在廚房能做什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"教官？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"我從博士那邊看到了你們的申請，就自作主張申請和你們同行了——以“監護人”的身分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅雷","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"說實話，博士很放心不下就這麼讓你們回去。我也放心不下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"凜冬姐……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"當然歡迎！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早露小姐，其實博士最初並不想同意你們的申請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"醫療部評估了你們的狀況，並建議我們更客觀謹慎地考慮你們的行動細節。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"但博士最後不是還是選擇尊重我們的決定嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是因為凜冬小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她直接闖到了博士的辦公室，保證會保護你們每個人平安回到羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像當初一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ceo"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"當初在切爾諾伯格時，我做到過，這次也會一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這不僅關乎你們的安危。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"本次與烏薩斯方面的接觸不同於過往。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我和娜塔莉婭盤算過，藉助她家羅斯托夫實業的名義，我們有更方便的身分行動——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我並不擔心你們的身分問題。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"羅德島同樣有途徑解決你們的身分問題。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"（遞出醫療部報告）","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"評估結果顯示你們沒有完全準備好。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你們有其他外勤任務的可選項。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"要幫羅德島，從來不只一個選擇。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們每個人或多或少都還是會害怕回去，但我們逃不開那個地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是所謂的“自我療癒的歸鄉之旅”，這是我們自認足夠適合執行烏薩斯相關行動後，深思熟慮的志願申請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"我們認可的家早就是羅德島了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我保證，我會帶她們無恙地回來……回家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭一直都比我更勇敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，關於和羅斯托夫實業合作的詳細內容，麻煩請凱爾希醫生和博士再多加考慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信這對我們的行動有益無害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題的，早露小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我依舊建議你們的行動區域暫時避開切爾諾伯格直轄區的活動範圍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯對其依舊維持了嚴格的管理，你們的身分依舊很敏感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會保持和本艦的聯絡，烏薩斯行動的許多事宜依舊需要交給你們判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一路順風，早露小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本艦會增派一批後勤幹員和醫療幹員與你們同行，保障你們行動的同時，也會探索在烏薩斯地區正式建立辦事處的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，知道你們要出發的消息之後，還有一個人找到了我，希望申請加入你們的隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（咕咕~）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"——？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"古米，把鍋放下，先填飽自己的肚子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？我已經好久沒有餓過肚子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"（咕~）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，可能是今天太興奮就忙到忘記了，真理姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"有你和凜冬姐在，沒事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"那也先吃飽了再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘴張開，小古米。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔——吃、吃不下了，烈夏姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，凜冬你有什麼個人用品要我幫忙一起帶著嗎？我帶了超超大的箱子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"那把娜塔莉婭送我的吉他帶上，省得她到時候又問東問西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"其他東西先丟家裡吧，又不是不回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"烈夏，你剛開始不是說什麼都不拿嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想起來有些破爛得丟給某個人。我們能順道去一趟謝拉格嗎，索尼婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"……好吧，我去向博士申報我們的行程——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"堅定的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位，請問，我能和你們一起去烏薩斯行動嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，雖然我的提議有點唐突……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"索尼婭，讓卓婭和我們同行吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"早露","speakerId":"char_197_poca","isRemote":false,"text":"這次增援任務會很漫長，我們可以互相照應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦艾","speakerId":"avg_405_absin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"娜塔莉婭你已經知道了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經和早露小姐溝通過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凜冬","speakerId":"char_115_headbr","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，不用擔心，卓婭。這又不是我們第一次合作出外勤——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"真理","speakerId":"char_195_glassb","isRemote":false,"text":"刻俄柏，等等，那些餅乾還沒有完全烤熟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，快攔住她，會吃壞肚子的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小嘟嘟”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（禮貌地攔住）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"avg_2013_cerber_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要趕不上了！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“小嘟嘟”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1726_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（生氣地打轉）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"小刻準備了很多很多的餅乾。\n餅乾要送給很好很好的人。\n很多很好的人都要出遠門了，他們在“家裡”很照顧小刻，所以小刻也不讓他們餓肚子。\n就是這樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ceo"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，這幾天每層的列印室都堆滿了人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"這次到各地的外勤增援是採購當地紀念品的好機會，同事們互相列的願望清單都夠開一次泰拉博覽會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾提出過讓採購部統一替幹員採買的建議，但是被我駁回了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保留這份儀式感吧，採購部稍後會發布通知提供報銷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，我這趟去維多利亞，您有什麼需要我幫忙帶回來的嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希搖了搖頭，略微有些疑惑地看著亞葉一直提在手中的餅乾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"刻俄柏剛剛強行把它塞到了我的懷裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"她剛才在廚房可是搞得天翻地覆，阿米婭現在都還在幫忙善後呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦阿米婭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉，你這一趟去維多利亞的任務並不輕鬆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除去回收幾個公爵領內辦事處的數據資料外，還需要額外留意納斯爾紗和葦草幹員的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盡可能協調各處辦事處為她提供適當的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，老師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那倫蒂尼姆……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通知海蒂暫時推遲回艦述職的安排。倫蒂尼姆議會恢復外交管道之後，核心圈國家的消息也在重新向那裡匯集。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海蒂經營至今的情報網路非常重要，這也是我安排你增援的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"……所以真實情況並沒有很樂觀？我會額外注意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉，放輕鬆一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你總是習慣把自己繃得太緊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看過你的任務行程，太緊太滿，我幫你刪減了一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"試著不要去思考你懼怕的事物，更不要試圖強行讓自己去掌控懼怕的事物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉，我從不期望從你身上看到你的母親……或是我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不贊同鼓勵經歷過痛苦的人忘記仇恨、忘記暴力，追求一個更好的時代所需要的，絕非放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"試著放慢腳步，亞葉。將想要更好地掌控生活的焦躁施加於自身，無疑是徒勞的自我折磨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去維多利亞的路程還很長，但我需要你記住你剛剛進入這個房間時的笑容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我唯一留給你的要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，我記住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"送您的紀念品，到時候我就按自己的心意選了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"再見，老師。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紅，你不用躲著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"……紅擔心凱爾希生氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希讓紅不要為敘拉古的事情難受……紅也讓凱爾希難受了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"紅這一次不想離開羅德島，紅怕凱爾希不同意……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒準備向S.W.E.E.P.發布調令，紅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留在本艦隨時待命就行，阿斯卡綸的命令很快就會到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"……那收到命令之前，紅可以就待在凱爾希身邊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以，你不是早就到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，紅早就到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些金蘿蔔罐頭是吉姆阿姨和老媽特意準備的，讓我送給同事們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱、抱歉，可能有點太多了……是不是應該先放廚房？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"小山一樣高的罐頭堆……","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"留給你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事出突然，太久沒有回家，老媽囤積的罐頭都快放不下了，每次都只會一股腦塞給我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你剛剛不是說特意為同事準備的嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，呃……都一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正都是我的東西，我來決定它們的用途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，到時候辛苦你幫忙送給其他同事了。小溫米的出發時間很趕，我實在來不及了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，對了，裡面標註了名字的兩罐是我特意留給你和阿米婭的，千萬不要送錯了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"看起來好像一樣。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你……當然不一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對哦，這次出發我也得帶上三十罐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"作為補給？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，禮物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小溫米和萊伊小姐有一位老朋友，杰里先生，他和吉拉小姐結婚後工作也越來越順利了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上次他寄來的照片裡已經多了很多小寶寶，小溫米和我們約定好要順路去拜訪他們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她們提起過。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"時間過得真快啊。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好在大家似乎都沒什麼變化嘛——嗯，阿米婭從卡茲戴爾回來後倒是成長了很多……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"也請照顧好溫米和萊伊小姐。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷姆必拓的情況我很熟悉，不會讓她們吃虧的。"}]},{"label":"請保重好自己。","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心好了，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很期待結束外勤任務後和你再見。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這次外勤任務涉及的區域很大，我恐怕又有很長時間沒辦法安安穩穩睡在我的小房間裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"放心，羅德島會等著你們回家。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！我知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴行","speakerId":"avg_230_savage_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那請等著我回來，博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，怎麼不走了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我突然想起來，之前準備的醫療藥品和照護手冊都還沒有分發到大家手裡，沒有專門提醒的話，肯定有人會忘記的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次外出的時間這麼長，大家會不會記得按時吃飯按時吃藥呢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"其他醫療幹員會負責的，你惦記這個幹嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是很多時候，大家就是顧不上照顧好自己，小炎熔你自己不也總是忘記帶我幫你準備的食物嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"我那是……算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有A1小隊裡其他的人……隊長要去執行的任務很危險，克洛絲也要自己一個人去很遠的地方，她們都沒問題嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……我受夠了！！能不能不要總是把別人當小孩啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"都過去這麼久了，誰還會是長不大的小屁孩啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道……我明白的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是覺得，突然要離開這麼多年和大家朝夕相處的地方，還不知道什麼時候才能回來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"心裡有點，空空的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……放心吧，我們會回來的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_0_rhodes3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島現在需要解決一些麻煩，我願意相信博士和凱爾希醫生，還有阿米婭，問題一定會處理好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們只要執行好自己的任務，耐心等待就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島就是我們的家，我們才不會失去她。無論什麼情況，我們都會回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……總有一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大家還會在一起的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodesinpatientcenter"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"體溫沒降下來，目前來看舊的藥物組合已經不再有效了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過你的代謝速度並沒有受到太多影響。等血液中的藥物濃度降下來，我會幫你注射幾種新藥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新藥物會放大你對疼痛的感知，不過我會幫你搭配更大劑量的鎮痛劑，別擔心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平靜的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平靜的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"其他床位……又空了一些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天離開的。不用擔心，他們只是暫時被轉運到其他地方，接受更有針對性的治療方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，有幾個人留了紙條給你，就在你的床頭櫃裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你的症狀很特殊，不適合變更治療環境，留在這裡接受我的觀察是最好的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"平靜的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛伊，你在看什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"天花板上，有幾個小圓點，一直在轉圈……看著很令人安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結晶還在干擾你的視覺系統。我已經把剝離視網膜附近的結晶列為下次手術的目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"每次我盯著它們看的時候，它們似乎都會悄悄湊近一些，好像在跟我說話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"你有聽到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"（閉眼）它們的聲音，很像我以前認識的那口鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你跟我提到過的，你家鄉的那座鐘樓嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"不只一座……我一直在嘗試修復它們。修復了很多次，可是最後還是毀在了炮火下——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"替你從駐派維多利亞的幹員那裡打聽過，那座鎮子已經重新修繕過了。當地人替你修好了那口鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"真好……鐘聲響起，生活就還在繼續，很令人安心，不是嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"華法琳最後一遍確認了各項儀器的讀數，隨後在輸液裝置中注入了調配好的藥物。\n儀器的蜂鳴聲、輸液泵運轉的噪音和克洛伊偶爾的痛苦喘息混雜在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"……華法琳醫生，這三年來，我們已經嘗試過多少種藥了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個交給我操心。你的各項身體指標變化都趨於平穩，這才是更重要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"在感染礦石病之前，我也經常在鐘樓裡照顧那些受傷的感染者士兵。我知道體表的石頭越來越多意味著什麼。"},{"type":"narration","text":"克洛伊努力調動臉部肌肉，但那些附著在肌膚上的微小尖刺卻扭曲了她的表情。傷口綻裂開，鮮豔的血珠沁出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"（苦笑）你看……連一個微笑，它都不允許我做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為醫生，我不能向你保證什麼結果。我只能向你承諾，羅德島的每一位醫療幹員，都會竭盡所能地治療你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，華法琳醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是……有點想念家鄉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這份檢測報告？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次拿到這位病人的醫療數據的時候，我也以為數據出了錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我們反覆檢查了很多遍，這個數值沒有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按理來說，這個體細胞與源石融合率，病人根本不可能還有生命跡象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這違背了我們長久以來對礦石病的所有認知——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是那些源石的確以一種無法預料到的方式維持著病人的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她體內的部分器官已經完全結晶化了，但它們的運轉效率卻比過往已有的案例都更加有效率且穩定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Touch","speakerId":"avg_npc_249_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我尚未判斷出這種病徵產生的原因，可就數據而言，感染程度越深，她似乎……越健康，也越痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是前所未有的病例，或許是礦石病的新變化，如果在治療方法上能有所突破……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"華法琳","speakerId":"avg_171_bldsk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些從維多利亞救回來的人也許真的能為羅德島帶來一些奇蹟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_115_headbr","aliases":["凜冬"]},{"speakerId":"char_144_red","aliases":["紅"]},{"speakerId":"char_195_glassb","aliases":["真理"]},{"speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","aliases":["古米"]},{"speakerId":"char_197_poca","aliases":["早露"]},{"speakerId":"char_260_durnar","aliases":["堅雷"]},{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亞葉"]}]}
